{"version":1,"content":"<p>近年積極在各地舉辦巡迴演唱會的鍾嘉欣（Linda），原定於今年12月31日除夕夜在汕頭體育中心體育館舉行《Remember【記得】汕頭超級跨年演唱會》，與歌迷一同倒數迎接新年。</p><p>然而，主辦單位日前突然發布緊急公告，宣布該場跨年演出正式取消並延</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:13:17.142358+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T05:52:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:06:40.305272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:06:40.305272+00:00","content_hash":"00f02f7baae83dfb9e73e995de284e36ced692b4d27384184b1e5a1be0d55257","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}